  intro hpredlaws hwfTm μ₀ μ₁ ρ₀ ρ₁ θ₀ θ₁ cf₀ cf₁ o₀ o₁ hθ₀ hθ₁ hwf hric₀ hric₁ htagR hRbound hcwr₀ hcwr₁ hagree a₀ a₁ pm hwfcfg₀ hwfcfg₁ ht₀ ht₁
